From db7a855c1c4f2f3b98d507b9b6492d5e35ebf14e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mattias Walström <lazzer@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:07:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Report errors from "done" callbacks to the originator
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
Organization: Wires
Organization: Wires

Applying a change can still fail in SR_EV_DONE, for example when the
system is reconfigured there.  The caller needs to see that in the
return code instead of having to read the logs.

The earlier attempt made the subscriber fail its own event processing,
the originator never saw the error.

Signed-off-by: Mattias Walström <lazzer@gmail.com>
